pf-s-xs:15px;"><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--12 pf-c-md--12 pf-c-lg--12"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-27d5cbfa" data-pf-type="Column"><div data-pf-scrolltop="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion2" class="sc-pkfPC GftoS pf-226a7873"><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-b8793e6d accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-5699c214 pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="99c214b0-0180-4af0-b047-ab4d2d0c9768" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Product Overview</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-beb8793e accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="99c214b0-0180-4af0-b047-ab4d2d0c9768" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: none;"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-qQKeD NKnmf pf-0180aaf0"><div><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-14b00180">Product Overview</span></div></div><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-f047ab4d"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-59eca3bd"><span style="font-weight: bold;">STEP INTO THE SPOTLIGHT WITH THE NEW IMPACT DISPLAY DOME<br></span>The Display Dome distinctive design will heighten your prominence and increase your exposure at your next event. The Display Dome fits in a regular 10’x10′ tradeshow booth and offers a high head clearance. Let the Display Dome work for you to draw prospects in and leave them with a lasting impression of your company.<br></span></p><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-4cf2e299"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-c3beb879"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Frame</span>: anodized aluminum<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Fabric</span>: 100 % polyester fabric with PU coating, B1 fire retardant certified, Water repellent<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Colors:&nbsp;</span>available: many colours and full digital printing.<br></span></p><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-5f8edd0b"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-23785f8e"><span style="font-weight: bold;">COMMAND ATTENTION WITH THE IMPACT EXPODOME <br></span>Create a dramatic presence with a cluster of Impact Expodomes interconnected together. Its unique design ensures a spectacular presentation of your corporate message every time. The Impact Expodome can be custom printed with your corporate colors and logos to create a lasting impression. Customize your shelter to fit your needs; add custom side walls, visors and flags to your Impact Expodome.<br></span></p><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-c9148ccc"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-e815c914"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Frame</span>: anodized aluminum<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Fabric</span>: 100 % polyester 500 denier fabric with PU coating, CPAI-84 / ULC S109 & NFPA 701 fire retardant certified, Water repellent<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Colors&nbsp;available:</span> many colours and full digital printing.<br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Accessories:</span> Side walls, Visor, Foot plate / weight bag, Connector, Visor Extension, Banner<br></span></p></div></div><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-60976384 accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-3adc8a73 pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="a63adc8a-73a0-474b-b11e-bb22835b5260" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Product Specs</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-5b526097 accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="a63adc8a-73a0-474b-b11e-bb22835b5260" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: none;"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-qQKeD NKnmf pf-8a73a047"><div><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-f1104da5">Product Specs</span></div></div><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-a0474bf1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-4e1997d7"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Silk Screen Printing:<br></span>The traditional way to have your logo applied to fabric products has been through a Silk Screen Print Application. This process involves an initial screen set up, however the application of the ink has a minimal cost and is ideal for larger volume orders. Silk Screen Print application is durable, vibrant and can make your image POP!<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Digital Printing:<br></span>We use “Cutting Edge” Dye sublimation printing technology to achieve full bleed graphics on your fabric products. This digital process dyes the fabric and allows for unlimited graphic possibilities for image and logo reproductions. If you desire to be the best and have the best, the Impact Instant Canopy Digital Print Process is the answer.<span style="font-weight: bold;"><br></span></span></p></div></div><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-5c101a2e accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-b2a992dd pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="a992ddc9-b100-44da-968b-c48948661c20" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Product Accessories</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-2b5c101a accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="a992ddc9-b100-44da-968b-c48948661c20" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: none;"><div class="sc-oUAMm bPnfgz pf-cb92ac5f pf-r-dg pf-r-dg-lg--4 pf-r-dg-md--4 pf-r-dg-sm--2 pf-r-dg-xs--2" data-pf-type="ProductList" style="--pf-s-lg:17px; --pf-s-md:17px; --pf-s-sm:17px; --pf-s-xs:17px;">{% assign collection_156546039867 = collections['canopy-accessories'] %}{% assign d